WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:09.240
We cannot be distracted by Donald Trump's
antics from the real crises and real responsibilities

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.170
and duties that we have.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:15.470
The virus, police killings, protests devolving
into chaos and violence.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.619
Removing Trump must be done.

00:00:17.619 --> 00:00:20.369
But Trump is very aggressively trying to distract
us.

00:00:20.369 --> 00:00:23.310
I already told you some of the ways earlier.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:29.880
And the latest is Trump tweeting that he will
be designating and TFA as a terrorist organization.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.770
Donald Trump, of course, announcing this on
Twitter, saying, quote, The United States

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:40.190
of America will be designated designating
and TFA as a terrorist organization.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:42.180
There's a few different things to talk about
here.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:50.670
And TFA is a militant left wing movement that
stands for and Thai fascism and TFA.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.750
OK, that's where the name comes from.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.430
And TFA is not centrally organized.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.960
It's a sort of umbrella designation.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:02.890
And TFA, I see, is more of a strategy than
a group of people per say.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.860
And sometimes they do violent things that
I vehemently oppose.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:13.930
I have been endlessly critical of many of
the tactics employed by individuals organizing

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:16.310
under the umbrella of Antifa.

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:22.190
It appears, though, that what Donald Trump
is trying to do here is not actually constitutional

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:25.090
in designating them a terrorist organization.

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:29.450
The United States State Department has a list
of terrorist organizations.

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:35.370
They are foreign and TFA is not foreign and
TFA is a domestic group.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.510
Even more importantly, if Donald Trump were
to designate and TFA as a terrorist organization,

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:46.700
they would lose some First Amendment protections
which apply only to foreign terrorist organizations.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:52.820
So understand that this is part of the framing
by Trump and William Barr that the recent

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:59.760
protests and unrest are merely left wing anarchists
looking to do violence and so chaos.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:05.670
Now, to be clear, there is no shortage of
anarchists all over the political spectrum

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:09.660
doing protesting, many with ulterior motives.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:13.310
But there is also plenty of right wing Astroturf.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:19.160
There is police escalation by way of haphazard
pepper spraying, shooting at media, et cetera.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:27.580
And this entire story of this is not genuine
anger and frustration with policing in America

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.890
or whatever else.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:35.510
These are provocateurs coming in from outside
that is being used to single handedly devalued

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:38.840
the complaints and concerns that the protesters
have.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.870
And we can't fall for that.

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:47.349
But this claim from Donald Trump that he will
be designating Antifa as a terrorist organization,

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:48.800
it's a political statement.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.760
It is not a law enforcement statement.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.610
It's really important to understand that.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:54.880
And it doesn't appear to be a legal statement
either.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:58.950
Trump really cannot designate a domestic group,
a terrorist organization.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.710
It would deny them their First Amendment rights.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:04.300
It would also deny them due process.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.270
And it is likely unconstitutional.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.430
And it's not something Trump is going to be
able to do.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:13.370
He may not even really try because understand
the State Department's list of foreign terrorist

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.370
organizations.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.849
You just can't put Antifa on that list.

00:03:16.849 --> 00:03:18.340
But he said it on Twitter.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.630
And that's the whole point.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.209
That's the big picture here.

00:03:21.209 --> 00:03:22.890
This is another attempt to distract.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.580
We must keep our eyes on the ball.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.440
Trump has failed on Corona virus.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:30.970
More than one hundred and five thousand have
died, 50 or 60 percent of those those deaths.

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:36.080
Those deaths could have been prevented by
a two week earlier, a request from Trump for

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:39.940
a 50 state stay at home order and actual testing
capacity.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:45.709
On that note, I don't want to get you to something
boring, but understand Trump's tweeting about

00:03:45.709 --> 00:03:49.430
designating and Tifa a terrorist organization.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:54.349
We still, after four months, aren't testing
five hundred thousand people a day in the

00:03:54.349 --> 00:03:55.360
United States.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:59.030
We still, after four months, aren't at the
absolute minimum testing.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.590
We need to really look at reopening the country.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.570
We have national unrest with protests, violence,
looting, destruction of property, arson.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:11.480
Trump's tweeting about an TIFA and that the
White House will release vicious dogs.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.050
To go after protesters if they get past the
fence.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.209
Oh, and by the way, the wall isn't being built.

00:04:17.209 --> 00:04:20.549
Trump didn't repeal and replace Obamacare
with something better like he said he would.

00:04:20.549 --> 00:04:22.810
His trade war with China has failed.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:26.040
Twenty five percent of the workforce is out
of jobs in the last 10 weeks.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:31.750
So, of course, Donald Trump is time trying
to take credit for Space X and make this about

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.850
an TIFA and otherwise pretend that he's doing
a great job.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:39.360
It is an abject failure that we have not seen
in the United States for a long time.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:43.590
I mean, you have you have to look at Bush's
failure on 9/11 when he said, let's go into

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:47.210
Iraq, even though they didn't they didn't
have anything to do with the 9/11 attacks.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.740
And this is all meant to distract.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:53.710
It actually is starting to feel like it may
not work.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:58.550
If you look at polling, cautious optimism
that what Trump is doing to distract isn't

00:04:58.550 --> 00:04:59.550
working.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.550
Assume nothing.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:00.872
Every one of us has to vote in November.

